	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama! Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The moment I catch a glimpse of Soujin-sama fighting in the distance, my feet unthinkingly carry me toward him.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, get back inside the Chancel Shrine.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I know that without my magicks, I am of absolutely no use to him!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even so, please grant me this! Allow me to bear witness!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone...”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Akari-sama says nothing more.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"A single glance is enough to reveal how dire his situation is.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"His arm is severed, and his clothes are soaked with blood.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh no...”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"If only Mitsurugi-sama's power would return to Soujin-sama...",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"But no matter how much I wish it, I am utterly powerless without my magicks.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"No, even with my magicks, I haven't been able to do a single thing to help Soujin-sama.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Am I truly so helpless?",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"At this rate, Soujin-sama will─!",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Hesitant and stagnant, indecisive and irresolute.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Thinkest thee to accomplish anything with such a blade?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am my lord's blade! My sole purpose is to heed her will and strike down her enemies!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A mere tool is incapable of hesitation!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A tool?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"─Soujin-sama is the furthest thing from a tool...",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"─He is a wonderful man of flesh and blood, the bravest warrior I have ever known!",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I nearly scream aloud my objection, but swallow my words at the last moment.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Wait. Wait, wait, wait.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"If Soujin-sama is indeed the same being as the Mitsurugi-sama of legend, then perhaps everything is not as I thought.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Created by the Founding Empress through the sacrifice of eight hundred and eighty-eight priestesses─",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The undying, ageless existence that will continue to preserve the Empire from calamity evermore─",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"That is Mitsurugi-sama.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"A legendary implement of destruction, the  ",
{"ruby", text="Exalted Divine Blade"},
"Ame no Mitsurugi. ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Considering his immortal nature, he just might be more inanimate object than flesh and blood human.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"And if that is the case, it is now clear to me what Okonogi-sama meant by “Go to Iseya and hone Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"To “hone Mitsurugi” was no metaphor; he meant literally to furbish Mitsurugi-sama with magicks.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-In that case...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"A beaten blade needs only to be sharpened.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"That's right. Perhaps what Soujin-sama needed to reclaim\nMitsurugi-sama's power was never Healing, but rather─",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Honing. The first rite of all priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That must be it.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestesses of the past must have served Mitsurugi-sama not by Healing his wounds, but by Honing his edge.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Why did I fail to think of this until now?",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"It must be because I could not bring myself to think of Soujin-sama as an object.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"But I will not hesitate any longer.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I stand straight, facing towards Soujin-sama with palm outstretched.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, thank you for everything that you have done for me.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you saying?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When I fall, please appoint Isuzu as the next Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She will undoubtedly be a most valuable ally to aid your cause.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you... W-Wait, Kotone, don't tell me you're gonna...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"This will be the last and greatest Honing Shiinoha Kotone will perform.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"With all my remaining life force as fuel, I will─",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop it, Kotone! Don't do this!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghh?!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Right before our eyes, Soujin-sama receives another grievous wound.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Even so, he does not let go of his blade.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Gritting his teeth with steely determination, he turns to face his enemy once more.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, there is no other way!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"If Soujin-sama is defeated here, the Empire's history will come to an end.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"If my life might be enough to deliver us from such a fate, that would be a small price to pay.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...All right. Do it.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Akari-sama nods ever so slightly, her face a mask of anguish.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"─Even to the very end, you truly cared about me.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Thank you very much, Akari-sama. I will never forget such kindness.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Your compassion, your consideration, it was far more than Shiinoha Kotone ever deserved.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee. Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The moment I speak the invocation, my spellforce drains away at an unbelievable rate.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The exertion induced by a spell of Healing is absolutely nothing in comparison.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nh, ghh...!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Sapped of all my strength in an instant, the edges of my vision rapidly close in.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not now... Not yet...! My powers are not so meager as this!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I draw out all the power lying dormant deep within my body.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Even as my soul burns to nothingness, even as my body turns to sand and drifts away, I pour more and more of my life force into the spell.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Look upon me, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Behold the last and greatest Honing Shiinoha Kotone will perform!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"I have made you wait long enough, Soujin-sama.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aah... Mitsurugi-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"The last sight I see before my vision fades to black is\nMitsurugi-sama's gleaming, golden figure.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Aah, how beautiful he is. How divine.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I go to my glory, that I might become a part of that radiance.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Oh... I finally understand now...",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"As the blade of the Empire, Mitsurugi-sama lives on through time unending.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"As such, no mere mortal is capable of walking by his side.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Even the Founding Empress was powerless to abate the merciless march of time.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But the Exalt-Priestess, she alone is different.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"By offering Mitsurugi-sama her life, she becomes his in body and soul, to have and to hold for all eternity.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Mitsurugi-sama need never know solitude or loneliness, because she will be there, forever by his side.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"That is why she will always be “Mitsurugi's bride.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"─Is that not so, Chihaya-sama?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... The time has come... to offer you all my life!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"With my last breath, I exhale the final vestiges of my power.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The final grains of sand slip through the hourglass of my soul.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I have nothing left to offer.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Let us walk together... through time unending...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Suddenly, an unprecedented surge of power courses through me.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"My body is aglow with an auric radiance.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Before I know it, my severed arm is restored, and the spellblade in my grip feels as light as air.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The vivifying force extends all the way to my extremities, and my once unsteady feet find firm purchase on the ground below.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This power...!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Could it be that of Mitsurugi?",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Visions of the dream I had flash through my mind, one after another.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"No, they are anything but figments of my imagination.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"They are nothing less than my own experiences.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"My own memories, graven indelibly upon my soul.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I see. I really am Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"With that realization, my heart falls still.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Unknown to wrath, or pain, or sorrow─",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"My purpose is nothing more than to cut down all that which threatens harm to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"My existence has no other value.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Thus am I able to become an unthinking blade to be wielded by my lord.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Indeed, that is all I ever was─a tool created by Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I haven't a complex heart, and bereft of such a heart, my blade remains untouched by hesitation or doubt.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"In this moment, I stand within the realm of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“A different man stands before me.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My conduct was most unsightly until now. I beg your forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Thinkest nothing of it.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono readies Hyakutan.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Have at thee. I shall face thy blade with all my being.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono closes in─",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"No ordinary man would even be capable of perceiving his tempestuous footfalls.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"His blade glides through the air like flowing water, up until the moment it is unleashed like a lethal flash of lightning.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Yet it does not faze me in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"As though time itself has slowed its inexorable march, each of Kokuan-dono's movements appear downright sluggish.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fuh!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I break his assault with a single swing.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono staggers backwards, his face betraying his shocked disbelief.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"A wide, crimson wound slowly sprouts across his chest.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“What manner of man art thou? Verily no ordinary warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, of the Myougikan.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That has not changed, Kokuan-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"There is no doubt that I once lived as Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"But now, I am none other than Tokita Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Nothing more than a simple warrior in the service of one Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“In that case, Tokita-dono...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Grantest me but one round of thine instruction!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono kicks aside his straw sandals.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"He's determined to fight to the death.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Haaah!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"His exhale as sharp as a blade's edge, Kokuan-dono flourishes Hyakutan faster than the mortal eye can perceive.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Three nearly simultaneous strikes, each aiming to pierce a separate vital point.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"An ultimate technique, impossible to parry or evade, sure to bring about certain death─",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Downpour.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"The very same blade arts technique that Tooru's son, the man who would later come to be known as the Forefather─",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Eventually, with great difficulty, managed to learn from ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"me.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I plunge my blade into the midst of that tempest of steel, deftly answering each strike in turn.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Mh...”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Turning aside his attack, my blade continues its course, catching Kokuan-dono across the cheek.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"He makes no move to wipe the blood dripping down the side of his face.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"He only presses his attack with even greater ferocity, an expression of purest joy on his face.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Is Kokuan-dono enjoying this?)”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Even if faint, his battle with me is nonetheless calling his true self back.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"That realization alone is enough to set me at ease, no matter what else happens.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono takes his distance after a furious exchange of blows.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Heavy beads of sweat slowly trickle down his chin and fall to the damp earth below.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“To think that I might live to come across a master of the blade as thyself... the Empire is vast indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Stilling his ragged breath, Kokuan-dono returns his blade to its sheath.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Let us put this to an end.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I shan't waste thy precious time any longer, Tokita-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"He emotionlessly intones, slowly lowering his center of gravity.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono's quick-draw Sickle Leaf─",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"A technique belonging to him alone, a legend whispered among all warriors.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"It is a decisive strike that places everything into the speed of one's blade, leaving the user completely open to counterattack should it be evaded.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"A move of last resort, one that unavoidably results in certain death for one of the two combatants.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Behold my most secret of techniques.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall bear witness!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono radiates a singular, deadly intent.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Time comes to a halt, and the air itself ceases to move.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"The most minuscule of differences will separate life from death.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Haaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"A flash of light surges forth from his waist.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Faster than the speed of sound, the shockwave produced from his blade tears towards me like the devouring maw of a feral beast.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"As the invisible beast closes in, I bring my spellblade down on its head.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"A thunderous roar rends through the air all around us─",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"That of the beast breaking itself upon the shockwave cast forth by my blade.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Its momentum unhindered, my strike continues forward, flinging Kokuan-dono through the air like a ragdoll.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Mmmmghh!”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono tumbles backwards over twenty meters before crumpling against a heavy boulder with a dull crash.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Ghh...! Nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Letting out a final, quiet groan, Kokuan-dono falls still.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"The wind carries with it a deathly silence.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Have I just slain my own master?",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Though he still draws breath, Kokuan-dono is not long for this world.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please forgive me, Kokuan-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only I could have allowed you to see Hotori one last time.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I lower my head and silently offer a prayer.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"In that instant, the ground trembles beneath my feet.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"An earthquake?",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"No... it's a phenomenon far more cataclysmic.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"The rumbling gives way to a canopy of light spanning all across the skies of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Spellcrests shimmer across the surface of the halo as it extends in all directions, emanating forth across the firmament.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Farther, farther still, until its edges disappear beyond the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This must be the Guardian Barrier...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"It's finally been activated.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Our apologies for having kept you waiting.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"A sonorous voice rings out across the clearing.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Behold the essence of magicks, the Guardian Barrier,",
{"ruby", text="The Pillar of the Empyrean"},
"Ama no Mihashira!”   ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“O foreign heathens who dare intrude upon the Empire's most sacred ground, lament your folly in your final moments.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, superintendent of Iseya, Shizukura Isuzu, beseeches Thee.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“May these ignorant trespassers be granted a swift demise!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"The next moment, it is as though the sky itself is falling.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Pillars of divine light descend from the spellcrests across the sky, laying waste to all that the light touches.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Helicopters and soldiers alike are disintegrated, reduced to their base elements.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"They disappear without a single trace, as though their very existence had been denied.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Inexplicably, none who are affiliated with the Empire are affected in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"The scouring light only targets those of the Republican Army, ablating their every trace before they are even able to scream.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"As stillness returns to Inner Iseya─",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Where once two thousand Republican soldiers stood, not a single soul remains.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"The halo in the sky fades to nothingness, leaving behind only a chilling silence.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Even still, I continue to stare up at the endless sky.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Whether Mitsurugi or the Guardian Barrier, the magicks of the ancients are grand beyond compare.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"The thought of it sends a shudder down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's over now, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"I turn to find Akari standing behind me, carrying Kotone on her back.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's Kotone doing here? Is she all right?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She's still breathing, but she won't wake up.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She used her magicks to give you power, and she's been like this ever since.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She did that for me...”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Even though we told her over and over to not use any more magicks.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, we need to get her treatment. Isuzu might know what to do.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"I turn towards the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Before that, you'll have to deal with me first.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“Never thought I'd live to see the Guardian Barrier's power on display.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Officer"},
			{
"“I'd expect nothing less of a weapon that consumes the very essence of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"This woman...",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Is the same woman I saw in Kotone's dream.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yagi Sekka.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hmm, you know who I am? I suppose Her Eminence must have told you.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Sekka replies with a composed smirk.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're acting awfully chummy. Just who do you think you are?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies for my belated introduction, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"She knows Akari's identity?",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My name is Yagi Sekka.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I am under orders from Her Excellency Elsa Valentine to apprehend the ringleaders behind the coup d'etat.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Miyaguni Akari, Tokita Soujin, and Shiinoha Kotone, you are hereby under arrest.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Will you give yourselves up and come quietly?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you seriously expect us to say yes?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Good, good. Have it your way.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I, for one, was hoping that you'd resist.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“After trekking all the way here to Iseya, can you blame me for wanting to have some fun?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Her Eminence over there is looking a little worse for wear, though. Don't tell me she's already given up the ghost.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She's just unconscious.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, that's a relief. I still have plenty of unfinished business with her.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Sekka's lips twist upwards in genuine delight.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"It's a hideous smile, dripping with malice.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Just who exactly is this woman, and why is she in league with the Republican Army?",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"In any case, she probably knows a thing or two about Hotori and the rest of our captured comrades.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You intend to take us on all by yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I wasn't expecting anything out of those soldiers in the first place. They already did their job serving as cannon fodder for the Guardian Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aren't you an Imperial? Why are you taking the Republic's side?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Because I hate the Empire more than anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Enough to want to exterminate every last one of you.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm guessing you were the one who brought the Republicans knowledge of magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The spellblade that mind-controlled poor little Hotori-chan, the bell that turned your warrior friends into sitting ducks at the Imperial Palace, all of it was my doing.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I sure do some good work, don't you think? Ehehee, ahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Have you any idea how many warriors lost their lives because of you?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll have you know, everyone in the Republican Army considers me their guardian angel.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“What, are you forgetting that all those soldiers you killed also have people they loved, homes they wanted to go back to?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I want to protect them! I can't stand the thought of any of them having to lose their lives!”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“...As if. They can all go die for all I care.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The only thing I want is to kill Imperials. As many as I can.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Akari grinds her teeth as she listens to Sekka's tirade.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hear you loud and clear.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Every second you spend breathing the same air as me is a second too long.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"I couldn't agree more.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that's one scary look you're giving me.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Sekka raises an elegant finger in our direction.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“How about you two take a little nap?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghh?!”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"My vision is blotted out in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"But this is no ordinary darkness.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"A mysterious black substance, cold as ice, roars past my ears as it envelops us in its chill.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Snow? ...That black snow!”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I know it's a little early, but I come bearing the first snowfall of the year.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Nothing but the finest black would do for Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"The driving snow is so dense I can't even see my hands.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What's going on? I... can't feel my...”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"Every part of me touched by the black snow grows numb with the cold.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"It's far beyond the numbness of a normal, physiological reaction.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"It's a remorseless, penetrating cold that threatens to freeze my heart to its very core.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ehehehee! How does it feel?”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Enjoying this taste of the same magicks that founded the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Strength fades from my limbs as the world before me grows dim.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"As though the proof of my own existence is weakening, I lose the ability to perceive even my own body.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"The intense fatigue causes my legs to buckle, and I fall to the ground alongside Akari.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"What magicks are these... that even Mitsurugi can be rendered powerless...?",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hehee... It seems to work especially well on Tokita-kun,\ndoesn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do... you mean...?”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My little secret.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You two can just stay where you are and watch.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"Sekka declares as she approaches Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You're the one I still have business with... Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Come now, naptime's over. On your feet.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Sekka roughly rolls Kotone face-up with the tip of her boot.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Yet the rage that boils up within me is soon numbed by the black snowstorm swirling around me.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Stop wasting my time.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Sekka leans down, holding her hand over Kotone's forehead.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't... touch her...”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Relax. I'm just giving her a little pick-me-up.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Sekka's hand glows with a faint light.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnm... ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"The next moment, Kotone stirs, letting out a slight groan.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"It looks like Sekka was telling the truth.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahaahh... Where... am I?”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"As I slowly blink my eyes open, the first thing I spot is a familiar face hovering over me.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"What is Sekka-san doing here?",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Did you have a pleasant slumber, Your Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Augh!”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Sekka-san brings her foot down on my chest.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“After going to the trouble of waking you up, I wouldn't mind a little gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Argh...! Ugh... You have... my sincere thanks...”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ahahaha! You really went ahead and said it!”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You never were all that bright, were you?”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Sekka-san finally lifts her leg off of me.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Come on then, on your feet.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“If you just keep on lying there, Her Highness is gonna freeze to death any minute now.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ghh... Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"Mustering up all the strength I have in my leaden body, I somehow manage to pick myself up.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"As I do, Soujin-sama and Akari-sama come into view.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Both of them are kneeling on the ground, engulfed in a storm of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What have you done to them?”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'm just giving them a chance to cool off while I settle my score with you.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You wish to fight me?”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You're welcome to say no and let them die.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"With Soujin-sama and Akari-sama as hostages, I have no choice but to comply.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why do you wish to fight me?”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Have I done anything to cause you affront?”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You have. You bet you have.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Sekka-san replies without a moment of pause, a dark flame flickering in the depths of her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I refuse to rest until all of Iseya is razed to the ground.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Even that would hardly be enough for the two thousand years of indignity House Yagi has endured at the hands of Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Yagis have been a venerable priestly lineage since the founding of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your house should have been receiving special status no less than that of the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Special status?”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Well, I suppose you're right in a way. We've always been treated as especially inferior.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"The Yagis are a house of great antiquity, held in no less esteem than House Shiinoha.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"As a result, they receive many special accommodations from the priesthood.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“House Yagi is called upon to perform the New Year's ceremonies on behalf of all Iseya, and you are always granted positions of privilege in grand rituals.”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is that not an honor for all those born as priestesses?”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hehehee... you really know nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“House Yagi has always been the enemy of the Iseyan priesthood.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“We were once the high priestesses of Ko no Kuni, the realm brought to ruin by Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"I recall the story of the Empire's founding that Soujin-sama recounted to me the other day.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"When the Empire was still known as Hi no Kuni, the Founding Empress rallied a confederacy of allied realms to stand against Ko no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Ko no Kuni possessed unrivaled military strength, and Hi no Kuni's fate seemed all but sealed.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"In a desperate bid for a brighter future, the Founding Empress created Mitsurugi-sama.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"Mitsurugi-sama's heroic exploits brought victory to Hi no Kuni, and all the separate realms were unified under one Empire─or so I have heard.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“With our homeland reduced to ash, we were forced to submit to Himi-no-Mikoto's will.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The magicks we spent so long developing, the Artifacts that were our national treasures─ all of it was stolen away from us.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"Sekka-san's needle-like gaze bores into me.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But the most unforgivable affront of all was\nHimi-no-Mikoto's repudiation of our god, Kuronushi-no-Ookami.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Not only that, she turned Kuronushi-no-Ookami's seat of power, the world of Ne no Kuni─”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Into a dumping ground for your unwanted karmic distortions!”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say... Ne no Kuni is...”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The dominion of Kuronushi-no-Ookami. The final resting place of our souls.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Imagine it, if you will.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“How would you feel if Oomikami's dominion of Takamagahara was defiled day in and out by the refuse of your magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"Just the thought of it causes my breath to catch in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even so, did Ko no Kuni not invite its fate with its war of aggression against Hi no Kuni?”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hi no Kuni was the true aggressor. Though that was two hundred years before Himi-no-Mikoto's time.”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“When Hi no Kuni first invaded, it took all that we had to barely stave off our own destruction.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Our resistance brought us a future, though it came at a great cost of lives and territory.”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ko no Kuni spent the next two hundred years rebuilding its power until it was finally able to stand against the threat of Hi no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I never knew...”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You'd do well to reflect on this, Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“To us, your Empire are invaders that destroyed our peace. Your priesthood are heretics that profane our deity.”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Never in a million years would House Yagi swear allegiance to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And yet, Iseya compels us to represent your priesthood and offer our prayers for the peace and prosperity of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"The way Sekka-san describes it, it sounds no different from me being kidnapped and forced to offer my prayers for the\nRepublic's continued prosperity.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"Nothing short of a humiliating display of subjugation for the vanquished.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Not to mention, we're forced to take on the most demanding role of all in your grand rituals.”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Though I suppose you're not wrong to call it a ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"position of privilege.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“My mother, my grandmother, generations and generations of my ancestors before her, all of them lost their lives during these rituals.”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"Sekka-san bites her lip hard enough to draw blood.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"Her eyes gleam with the burning light of hatred.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I, too, was forced to participate in a ritual to reinforce the Barrier three years ago, on the day the war broke out.”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I had the privilege of being the vessel to receive all the retribution in case the karmic distortions couldn't be disposed of properly.”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But that makes you a living simulacrum!”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"Such a role could be described as nothing short of a human sacrifice.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"If what Sekka-san says is true, then have I been blind to the true nature of Iseya this entire time?",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"Somehow, the pristine air of Inner Iseya begins to feel oppressively stagnant.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Fortunately for me, the Republic happened to destroy the Barrier and save my life.”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Could you blame me if I wanted to repay the favor?”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Not that I actually feel indebted to them, of course. All they cared about was ensuring their invasion went smoothly.”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Still, they wound up serving as a convenient ally.”",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“It doesn't matter to me how I get there, as long as I can destroy the priesthood and the Empire that built themselves on the sacrifices of House Yagi.”",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"Sekka-san's revelations leave me speechless.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"At first, I thought her actions unforgivably evil, but now...",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, what unspeakable sins we priestesses have wrought...”",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I cannot begin to imagine the suffering you must have endured.”",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Spare me your pity.”",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			{
"The skies suddenly darken, as though the sun was swallowed whole.",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"I look up to find thick, black clouds blotting out the sky.",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“For as much as I hate the Empire, I don't think it did anything wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The strong do what they can, and the weak suffer what they must. That's just the way the world works.”",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And now, it's the Empire's turn to be trampled under the\nRepublic's boot!”",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But─!”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“It was nice knowing you, you pathetic Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"With a dreadful rumble, the black clouds overhead descend even lower.",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			{
"A chilling gust of wind blows over me, powerful enough to nearly knock me off my feet.",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san, what are you intending to do?!”",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hehehee... You've piled up more than enough black snow in our world, so I intend to return the favor.”",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please stop this!”",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			{
"The black snow she speaks of are karmic distortions.",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			{
"If these are returned to this world, they will tear apart its karmic fabric.",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"All the boons we have obtained through the miracle of magicks will be unmade and come down as a great deluge upon the land.",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			{
"Affliction and pestilence, war and strife, death and disaster─",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			{
"The world will surely be visited with every calamity imaginable.",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please stop! If you seek vengeance, have it with my life alone!”",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll do what I want!”",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“If you want to stop me, just go ahead and try it, Exalt-Priestess!”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			{
"The wind blows even stronger.",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			{
"A deafening cacophony reaches my ears as tiles are ripped from the temple roofs and smashed into nearby structures.",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san...”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"House Yagi was subjugated by the Empire and forced to renounce its faith.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			{
"And for two thousand years, its descendants were pressed into serving as human sacrifices for the Empire's rituals.",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			{
"To describe Sekka-san's enmity as a long-standing grudge would do it no justice. Just how much hatred must be swirling around inside her right now?",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			{
"...I cannot help but pity her.",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"Though I dare not compare myself to her, I know all too well how it feels to be scorned and reviled because of your ancestry.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			{
"The injustice, the indignity of it all made me lament having ever been born.",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			{
"With no one around me able to understand my anguish, I spent many lonely nights crying myself to sleep.",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"It may not amount to even one percent of the outrage Sekka-san endured, but I have still tasted the same suffering as her.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"Were my life enough to slake her thirst for vengeance, I would gladly offer it.",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			{
"But she desires much, much more blood, that of every last citizen of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			{
"The lives of all the people who have entrusted their futures to the priestood─to me, their Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			{
"And so, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I will protect them.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[434]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san, I understand how much you have suffered.”",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I will not allow you to bring harm upon my people.”",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You think you can stop me?”",
			},
		},
		[437]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You don't even have any power left!”",
			},
		},
		[438]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[439]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The last Exalt-Priestess picked the wrong successor.”",
			},
		},
		[440]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The superintendent of Iseya was clearly the better choice,\ndon't you think?”",
			},
		},
		[441]={
			{
"I know that without needing to be told.",
			},
		},
		[442]={
			{
"In both scholastics and magicks, Isuzu was always head and shoulders better than me.",
			},
		},
		[443]={
			{
"I know that. But even so─",
			},
		},
		[444]={
			{
"My predecessor still chose me to succeed her.",
			},
		},
		[445]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even so, the Exalt-Priestess standing before you is none other than Shiinoha Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[446]={
			{
"I slowly knit my hands together in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[447]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I know better than anyone that I have no power left whatsoever.”",
			},
		},
		[448]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“All I can do is pray.”",
			},
		},
		[449]={
			{
"The foundation of magicks has never been anything more than prayer─a sincere supplication to Oomikami for His divine will to be done.",
			},
		},
		[450]={
			{
"Long before the Founding Empress used Ne no Kuni to remake the system of magicks─",
			},
		},
		[451]={
			{
"Even long before the establishment of ancient magicks and the use of simulacra─",
			},
		},
		[452]={
			{
"Priestesses still prayed to Oomikami, and their prayers gave birth to miracles.",
			},
		},
		[453]={
			{
"No, perhaps even that is not looking back far enough.",
			},
		},
		[454]={
			{
"Prayer is an act that has been available to all people since time immemorial.",
			},
		},
		[455]={
			{
"And of all those offering their prayers, those who were most successful in supplicating Oomikami eventually came to be recognized as priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[456]={
			{
"Making offerings, speaking invocations, conducting rituals, these are all simply means to increase the likelihood that your prayer will be heard.",
			},
		},
		[457]={
			{
"But all that was ever needed is an earnest heart, one capable of moving Oomikami to action with the sincerity of its prayer.",
			},
		},
		[458]={
			{
"Such are primeval magicks─",
			},
		},
		[459]={
			{
"Magicks wrought without the cost of any karmic distortions; pure, divine miracles that change the natural order of the world from its very essence.",
			},
		},
		[460]={
			{
"What are the odds that Oomikami will hear and grant this prayer of mine?",
			},
		},
		[461]={
			{
"One in a million? A billion? A trillion?",
			},
		},
		[462]={
			{
"I know not, but I will entreat it of Him all the same─",
			},
		},
		[463]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That I might protect all that is",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"precious to me.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[464]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly. As dust to dust, all my body, all my soul, I offer unto Thee!”",
			},
		},
		[465]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hear my prayer, and smite down this priestess wishing harm upon the people with Thy divine power!”",
			},
		},
		[466]={
			{
"The black clouds looming in the sky are dispelled in an instant, as though consumed by the sun itself.",
			},
		},
		[467]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“What in the...”",
			},
		},
		[468]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-Oomikami...?”",
			},
		},
		[469]={
			{
"A ray of light bursts forth from the sun shining high in the azure sky, descending upon the altar in the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[470]={
			{
"Upon the altar rests a sacred bronze mirror polished smooth by over two thousand years of prayer.",
			},
		},
		[471]={
			{
"The mirror catches the purifying light perfectly, redirecting it with a singular, predestined will.",
			},
		},
		[472]={
			{
"This is unmistakably Oomikami's divine power.",
			},
		},
		[473]={
			{
"Scouring all impediments, natural or manmade, that stand in its path, the light proceeds inexorably towards its ordained destination─",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
